Line 1: A chart needs a list of numbers or amounts, or a map to them, but this is text.
    save a bar chart of "x" as "a.svg".
                        ^^^
A chart shows numbers or amounts, like "a list of 3, 5 and 2" or "the total price of orders per day".

Line 3: A chart needs a list of numbers or amounts, or a map to them, but this is a list of text.
    save a pie chart of names as "b.svg".
                        ^^^^^
A chart shows numbers or amounts, like "a list of 3, 5 and 2" or "the total price of orders per day".

Line 4: A chart's title has to be text, but this is a number.
    save a line chart of a list of 1 and 2 as "c.svg", titled 5.
                                                              ^

Line 5: The name of a file has to be text, but this is a number.
    save a bar chart of a list of 1 and 2 as 7.
                                             ^
